### Create Article
POST {{api}}/articles
Authorization: Token {{token0}}

{
    "article": {
        "title": "title",
        "description": "description",
        "body": "body",
        "tagList": ["minh", "hoc", "code"]
    }
}

### Get Feed Articles
GET {{api}}/articles/feed
Authorization: Token {{token}}

### All Articles with auth
GET {{api}}/articles
Authorization: Token {{token}}

### Articles by Author with auth
GET {{api}}/articles?author={{username}}
Authorization: Token {{token}}

### Single Article by slug, without auth
GET {{api}}/articles/{{slug}}

### Single Article by slug, with auth
GET {{api}}/articles/{{slug}}
Authorization: Token {{token}}

### Update Article
PUT {{api}}/articles/{{slug}}
Authorization: Token {{token}}

{
    "article": {
        "title": "Slug",
        "body": "",
        "description": ""
    }
}

### Favorite Article
POST {{api}}/articles/slug/favorite
Authorization: Token {{token}}

### Unfavorite Article
DELETE {{api}}/articles/slug/favorite
Authorization: Token {{token}}

### Create Comment for Article
POST {{api}}/articles/{{slug}}asd/comments
Authorization: Token {{token}}

{
    "comment": {
        "body": "minhhoccode111 created a comment"
    }
}

### Get Comments for Article, without auth
GET {{api}}/articles/{{slug}}/comments
    ?limit=10
    &offset=0

### Get Comments for Article, with auth
GET {{api}}/articles/{{slug}}/comments
    ?limit=10
    &offset=0
Authorization: Token {{token}}

### All Comments for Article without login
GET {{api}}/articles/{{slug}}/comments

### Delete Comment for Article
@commentId = f342d4d6-3b20-4440-a317-1056ac8fa458
###
DELETE {{api}}/articles/{{slug}}/comments/{{commentId}}
Authorization: Token {{token}}

### Delete Article
DELETE {{api}}/articles/{{slug}}
Authorization: Token {{token}}

### Profile
GET {{api}}/profiles/{{username}}
Authorization: Token {{token}}

### Follow Profile
POST {{api}}/profiles/{{username}}/follow
Authorization: Token {{token}}

### Unfollow Profile
DELETE {{api}}/profiles/{{username}}/follow
Authorization: Token {{token0}}

